.el .ds Aq '
.TH swarm-export 1  "swarm 0.2.0" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-export \- Write a repo and its signed state to a bundle file for offline transfer
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm export\fR <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR> [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fILINK\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write a repo and its signed state to a bundle file for offline transfer
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Bundle file to write
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object on stdout
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fILINK\fR>
A repo ID or link
